Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.14,0:00:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across\Nthe sea Raising our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.48,0:00:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,voices We take in the beautiful blue world
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.94,0:00:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to go Everybody rejoices
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go get the sails all unfurled
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah yeah Here we are\Nin between the sea and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,the sky Ready now for adventure We're itching\Nto try Get ready to roam So all aboard
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.84,0:00:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,now we're set to go Set sail to the ocean
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.46,0:00:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,so deep Ready for a truly grand adventure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.30,0:00:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well don't you think that sounds really\Nfun All this excitement is second to none
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.20,0:00:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across\Nthe sea Raising our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.82,0:00:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,voices we take In the beautiful blue world
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.30,0:00:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to go Everybody rejoices
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.92,0:01:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go get the sales all unfurled
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.90,0:01:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's something that I just won't ever\Nforget It's the way that I felt when our
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.98,0:01:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,journey was set Now I won't be scared As
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.48,0:01:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,long as I keep that\Nfeeling there With that,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.90,0:01:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,let us keep up the pace While\Nenjoying every trip from place to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.40,0:01:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,place Our timid hearts get the\Nrhythm ingrained So let's keep going,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.40,0:01:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,adventure awaits So many treasures\Nawait So now let's raise our voices
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.66,0:01:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,in pride Laughing out when they are\Nfound With all the riches in hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.62,0:01:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,everybody rejoices Party on,\Ncause we stand tall and proud
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.68,0:01:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is adventurous. Be aware it's\Ndangerous. Who's gonna be one of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And a trip goes on because.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.44,0:01:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the pirates of the mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,To the west, to the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.98,0:02:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta find my way, sail away,\Nall the way to one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.78,0:02:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring all your dreams with\Nyou now, fill the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.26,0:02:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In your heart, spread your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And believe that you can soar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let the breeze guide the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Till you're ready to start up once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're ready for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.22,0:02:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So many treasures away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So now let's raise our voices in pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing out when they are found.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.46,0:02:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the riches in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices, party on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.82,0:02:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we stand tall and proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.76,0:02:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop. You can't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.82,0:02:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The damn thing's a zombie.\NYou'll get right back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.18,0:02:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.16,0:02:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.07,0:02:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.38,0:02:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You, I know you're from somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.88,0:02:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Never fear, I've got this under control!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.24,0:02:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.26,0:02:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the dead can be killed\Nif you know their weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.00,0:03:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.48,0:03:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing would be\Nthe soul of the zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.76,0:03:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.96,0:03:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it coming out of his mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.48,0:03:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No, captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.12,0:03:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.82,0:03:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.96,0:03:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Return to your rightful owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.90,0:03:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Terraron!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.64,0:03:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He killed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.28,0:03:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He killed our captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.30,0:03:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.42,0:03:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You obliterated the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.78,0:03:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.38,0:03:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I purified him. Pure what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.36,0:03:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.68,0:03:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.82,0:03:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the humming swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.12,0:03:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the one who wreaked all that\Ndestruction on Thriller Park five years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.98,0:03:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta report this to the master!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.02,0:04:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know that web feels\Nlike it's stronger than steel,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.32,0:04:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,but you can melt right\Nthrough it with fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.28,0:04:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.14,0:04:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be damned, you're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.92,0:04:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat and the rest of the\Ncrew got captured, so let's talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.04,0:04:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem to know a lot about\Nthis creepy island. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.26,0:04:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just I'm not really sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.86,0:04:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How to say this but if your friends\Nhave already been captured then
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.38,0:04:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a very high probability\Nthat it's too late to help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.30,0:04:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey? Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.84,0:04:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean? Too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.50,0:04:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't bear to be such hostility!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.24,0:04:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But then again I am a skeleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.00,0:04:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So I don't have a face.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.02,0:04:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Skull joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.86,0:04:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.88,0:04:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He's already dead, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.12,0:04:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, try to be serious\Nfor a moment here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.16,0:04:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I know he's annoying, but he's still dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.96,0:05:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried to explain this\Nwhile aboard the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.42,0:05:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But there was a great deal\Nof time many years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.48,0:05:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,that I spent drifting aimlessly\Nabout the sea, lost and all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.44,0:05:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,When I thought that I'd finally charted\Nmy escape from this demonic sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.90,0:05:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,my rudder broke and I was\Ncast even further into
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.20,0:05:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,the depths of this watery\Nvoid and then it happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.16,0:05:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose it was about five years\Nago much in the same way that it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.18,0:05:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,happened to you the island of Thriller\NBark called out to me I was utterly
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.36,0:05:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,desperate to escape the Florian\Ntriangle no matter the risk so I took a
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.70,0:05:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,chance and decided to scour the island\Nhunting for parts to fix the rudder.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.90,0:05:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,All that was to be found on the island\Nwas a horde of monsters and zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.48,0:05:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't take long before they captured\Nme and brought me to this building.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.56,0:05:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It was here that I witnessed\Nsomething incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.70,0:05:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,With me was a Kong fu dancer who had\Nalso been captured some time before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.76,0:06:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They brought him before a stitched-up\Ncorpse they referred to as a marionette.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.40,0:06:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I knew it, one of the most frightening\Ncreatures I had ever seen appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.96,0:06:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and then the dancer's shadow was ripped
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.92,0:06:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,right from his body and it was amputated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.54,0:06:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,how is that even possible\Ni could hardly believe
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.08,0:06:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,my eyes when i saw it\Nluckily i don't have eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.88,0:06:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,cut the crap i'm gonna beat\Nyou up now that i can approve.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.04,0:06:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't take him long to finish with\Na dancer and move on to my shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.08,0:06:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Once your shadow is taken, you\Nfall lifeless to the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.48,0:06:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But the shadow remains active,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.46,0:06:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,struggling up until the moment\Nit's confined within the corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.76,0:06:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And once this act is complete,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.54,0:07:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I witness the marionette go from lifeless\Nmeat to a full-blown dancing zombie!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.92,0:07:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You gonna explain this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.00,0:07:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.08,0:07:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter whom\Nthe corpse belongs to,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.40,0:07:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,the shadows retain the characteristics\Nof the soul they originate from.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.60,0:07:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, the shadow at\Nyour feet is the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.14,0:07:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That reflection of your soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.86,0:07:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,your other half, if you will, is intended\Nto follow you from birth until death.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.72,0:07:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Only one man possesses\Nthe loathsome ability
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.16,0:07:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,to force those shadows to submit to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.32,0:07:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A member of the seven warlords\Nof the sea, Gecko Moria.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.30,0:07:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He's endowed with the power\Nof the shadow shadow fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.38,0:07:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Devil Fruit powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.72,0:07:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The only materials needed to\Nmake a zombie are a corpse
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.98,0:07:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,in the living shadow of\Nsome unfortunate individual.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.66,0:07:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But the zombies, you see,\Nare not merely corpses,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.72,0:07:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but a collection of human and animal\Nparts stitched together by Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.92,0:07:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hawkback.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.83,0:07:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Merde is a brilliant accomplice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.48,0:07:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He collects the corpses of legendary\Nwarriors from around the world and,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.30,0:07:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,using his medical expertise,\Noutfits their bodies with new parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.70,0:07:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And trust me, he's amassed\Nquite the collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.22,0:08:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A countless number of monstrosities stored\Naway in his lab and ready to live again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.10,0:08:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr. Hogback, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.00,0:08:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a well-renowned surgeon\Nwho disappeared some time ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.40,0:08:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and to think he's been using his\Nskills to help a pirate ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.06,0:08:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So, these zombies aren't really\Nresurrected from the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.38,0:08:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They've just got somebody else's soul\Nworking away inside their bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.24,0:08:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.16,0:08:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The personality and fighting ability\Ncomes from the Shadow's original owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.42,0:08:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,but the physical strength is completely\Ndependent upon the corpse itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.90,0:08:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,When these two elements are both powerful,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.72,0:08:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,their combination creates\Na truly formidable zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.62,0:08:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is why Moria is so\Neager to get his wicked
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.36,0:08:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,hands on those with ample\Nbounties on their head?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.58,0:08:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.98,0:08:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,At least we know why we're being targeted\Nnow I imagine one of the greatest
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.82,0:08:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,advantages for Moria is the absolute\Nobedience that zombies provide.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.30,0:08:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He needn't worry about winning the\Nfavor of their original personalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.34,0:08:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A living army of such powerful fighters
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.72,0:08:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,would be too difficult\Nfor anyone to control.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.92,0:08:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.83,0:09:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,and since the shadows he takes have the\Nsame abilities as their original owners,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.96,0:09:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,then he has no need for the less\Nmanageable bodies they were attached to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.16,0:09:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The stronger they are, the faster he sends\Nthem out to sea, before they wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.36,0:09:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But that means we gotta find our guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.32,0:09:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They're alright for now.\NThere's still time to save them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.40,0:09:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,However, you must put your complete trust\Nin me if you want to accomplish that,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.16,0:09:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,as my experience will have to serve\Nas your guide. What? Trust you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.22,0:09:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.12,0:09:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Rejected! Skullsack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.72,0:09:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been years since I've had such\Nan emotionally engaging conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.86,0:09:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.74,0:09:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to tell\Nus what to do or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.46,0:09:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.62,0:09:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Gloria!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.70,0:09:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Your three guests have\Narrived, Master! They're early.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.34,0:09:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoo them in!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.00,0:09:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Right this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.30,0:10:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.21,0:10:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you could make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.24,0:10:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now hurry and make me king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.46,0:10:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.38,0:10:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you say about king of the pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.52,0:10:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's gonna be king\Nof the pirates but me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.86,0:10:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now untie these damn ropes, you jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.46,0:10:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.52,0:10:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp, Nami, Chopper, Sanji,\NZoro, give me back my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.30,0:10:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you put them, you big fat onion?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.54,0:10:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite an energetic fellow we've got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.04,0:10:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I take it this is Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.16,0:10:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you know what Straw Hat Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.50,0:10:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You just dropped a lot of names there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.60,0:10:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But we've only caught three of\Nyour guys so far, including you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.08,0:10:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got Pirate Hunter Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.02,0:10:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and some lanky blonde guy who was with your\Ncrew, but doesn't seem to have a bounty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.28,0:10:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do I know with blonde\Nhair besides Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.02,0:10:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.56,0:10:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.66,0:11:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,They caught Zoro and Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.74,0:11:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.10,0:11:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,They got them and Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.90,0:11:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No offense, but they're the\Nstrongest guys on our crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.90,0:11:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell were they the\Nfirst ones to get caught?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.38,0:11:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know who any of these guys\Nare, but they are seriously dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.24,0:11:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.74,0:11:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to the three\Nyou're in charge of Perona?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.38,0:11:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.29,0:11:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought the Risky Brothers were\Nsupposed to deliver them to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.30,0:11:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They're supposed to give them\Nto Kumasi, but they haven't yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.10,0:11:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hope they didn't\Nescape during transit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.44,0:11:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.82,0:11:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They're talking about us. Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.88,0:11:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell them, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.60,0:11:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you to keep your mouth shut?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.84,0:11:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too strict on Kumasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.20,0:11:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbearably strict, you might say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.36,0:11:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Among these three, my bride-to-be\Nis the one to watch out for.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.50,0:11:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,She caused a rebellion of sorts\Nin the middle of your garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.58,0:11:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hang on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.62,0:11:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.38,0:12:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You, you better not have laid a single\Nsick finger on my bride, you bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.66,0:12:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You bring her to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.04,0:12:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Your bride doesn't want\Nyou. What, Century?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.04,0:12:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.92,0:12:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on, Century.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.54,0:12:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not helping matters here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.18,0:12:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And by the way, why do you always\Nstand in front of me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.42,0:12:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,She doesn't want you either
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.70,0:12:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Your whining's giving me a headache\Nif those pirates somehow get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.70,0:12:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I hold every one of you responsible
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.44,0:12:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I Gathered the three of you here\Nto commemorate the birth or rather
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.92,0:12:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,the rebirth of a powerful new\Naddition to the crew of Thriller Park?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.50,0:12:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He really is quite impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.62,0:12:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Master the Pirate's escaping.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.44,0:12:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He ate right through the bars of the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.34,0:12:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He did what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.70,0:12:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He ate the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.92,0:12:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just see you jerks\Ntrying to catch me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.12,0:12:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Fast, fast, fast, fast, fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.00,0:13:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a promising shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.98,0:13:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Absalom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.34,0:13:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in a tight space here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.68,0:13:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me catch him, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.08,0:13:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'd like to see you try, Slowpoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.76,0:13:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a damn hollow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.34,0:13:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.25,0:13:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to die and be\Nreincarnated as a sea cucumber.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.78,0:13:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,First he wants to be a pirate king,\Nthen a knight, and now a sea cucumber?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.92,0:13:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.83,0:13:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.74,0:13:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's illuminate our friend here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.12,0:13:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do, you jerk?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.54,0:13:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make you pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.22,0:13:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.13,0:13:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.26,0:13:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.88,0:14:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.96,0:14:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.76,0:14:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The shadow of a man with a 300\Nmillion fairy bounty is all mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.38,0:14:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we'll create the most powerful\Nspecial zombie the world has ever seen!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.70,0:14:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.61,0:14:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Return to the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.90,0:14:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You want us to go back on board the Sunny?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.24,0:14:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.46,0:14:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If your comrades have been\Ncaptured, I fear the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.36,0:14:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,By now, and if not very soon, they will\Nhave surely had their shadow stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.36,0:14:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But even if that's the\Ncase, they won't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.96,0:14:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Their bodies will likely\Nbe taken back to your boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.80,0:14:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You see this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.71,0:14:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll end up just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.58,0:14:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.49,0:14:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The shadow part, not the dead part!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.46,0:14:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.50,0:14:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move on. Anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.52,0:15:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,like you were saying, even if you have\Nyour shadow taken, you won't die, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.24,0:15:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that would be correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.68,0:15:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But whenever it's taken, you immediately\Nweaken and lose consciousness,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.44,0:15:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,usually for about two days or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.64,0:15:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If the victim is strong enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.36,0:15:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,then they'll put the bodies on a ship\Nand send them to drift out in the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.04,0:15:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,which is why I'm urging\Nyou to return to yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.58,0:15:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Any guess as to why they do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.38,0:15:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.29,0:15:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I would assume it's to prevent the victims\Nfrom trying to take back their shadows,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.42,0:15:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.33,0:15:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.25,0:15:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,why don't they just kill them\Nwhile they're unconscious
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.56,0:15:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and get it over with that's\Nsomething they cannot do
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.10,0:15:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.56,0:15:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So be sure to pay close attention
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.00,0:15:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Firstly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.78,0:15:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though the body and\Nshadow have been separated.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.22,0:15:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They still represent one\Nbeing think of the shadow as a
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.46,0:15:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,soul if the body dies the\Nshadow will disappear as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.62,0:15:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thusly killing the host\Nzombie in the process
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.22,0:15:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,since they're trying to\Nbuild an army of minions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.76,0:15:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This would certainly\Nnot bode well for them
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.94,0:15:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Secondly,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.90,0:15:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,in the likely event that your friends\Nhave had their shadows stolen,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.14,0:16:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,they would most definitely\Nstill be alive and their
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.50,0:16:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,bodies would be returned to\Nyour ship as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.70,0:16:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is why the two of you must not\Nlose your shadows as well. If you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.02,0:16:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,all hope will be lost\Nand you'll be forced to
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.12,0:16:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,wander these seas\Naimlessly for all eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.66,0:16:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,While you have this window of opportunity,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.78,0:16:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,you should use it to attempt\Nto awaken your comrades.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.46,0:16:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you do you must regroup and\Nformulate a plan to reclaim their shadows
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.88,0:16:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand does all\Nof this make sense? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.34,0:16:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think so your shadow story wasn't\Nso crazy after all both of you take this
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.66,0:16:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.54,0:16:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The weakness of these zombies hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.50,0:16:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You've seen its power.\NThis was the weapon I
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.22,0:16:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,used to defeat that spider\Nmonkey their weakness, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.46,0:16:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.37,0:16:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this stuff, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.36,0:16:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's ordinary salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.34,0:16:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just salt?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.02,0:17:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Not exactly what I had in mind\Nas the vanquisher of evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.94,0:17:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it lift a curse or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.24,0:17:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose that would be\None way of putting it, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.98,0:17:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The reanimated life of these zombies is\Nbrought about by a Devil Fruit power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.14,0:17:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And just as one who is a power\Nholder is weakened by seawater,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.70,0:17:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,the salt that is contained\Nin that water can also be
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.10,0:17:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,used as a weapon to unbind\Nthe shadow from a zombie?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.84,0:17:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,leaving them permanently deceased.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.74,0:17:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.82,0:17:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And when this spider monkey went down,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.06,0:17:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,that black thing that\Nfloated out of him afterwards
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.02,0:17:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,was someone else's shadow\Nthat he'd been given.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.38,0:17:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,To think something so simple\Nwould be their weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.04,0:17:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So in summation, in order to defeat the\Nzombies, simply throw salt in their mouths.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.72,0:17:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the trick. Salt. Mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.02,0:17:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Deader than dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.10,0:17:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Make no bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.01,0:17:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, Brooke.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.93,0:17:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But how do you know so much about\Nthis island and its residents?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.88,0:17:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And how do you know the zombies' weakness?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.78,0:17:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It all relates back to an incident\Non this island five years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.36,0:17:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The time when I lost my shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.02,0:17:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I was sent out to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.50,0:17:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like all the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.00,0:17:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Luckily I awoke and was\Nable to retrace my path.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.48,0:17:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And return here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.52,0:18:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.72,0:18:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I went ashore and began my battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.32,0:18:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I fought against
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.50,0:18:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The very zombie that had my shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.26,0:18:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, the outcome\Nwas a crushing defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.22,0:18:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I vowed to survive\Nno matter what I faced.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.50,0:18:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.92,0:18:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it was shameful,\NI had to keep on living.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.36,0:18:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an obligation, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.54,0:18:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I was the only survivor of my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.36,0:18:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,One day, I will escape these evil seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.58,0:18:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and make good on the promises\Nmade by myself and my comrades.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.62,0:18:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Until then, I cannot die a second time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.78,0:19:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sadly, living longer hasn't helped me to\Nkeep my promises or reach my goal at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.00,0:19:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But this time, I'm back\Nand I won't run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.24,0:19:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Not until I defeat that\Nman and reclaim my shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.50,0:19:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in a hurry, so please excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.58,0:19:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be on my way now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.68,0:19:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.70,0:19:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.28,0:19:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,While you're still in a mood to talk,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.44,0:19:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,there's one more burning question\NI still need an answer to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.48,0:19:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.86,0:19:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.42,0:19:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not possible. Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.56,0:19:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,His shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.56,0:19:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He cut it off and took it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.46,0:19:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.72,0:19:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We've heard about this, haven't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.58,0:19:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't that skeleton say the\Nsame thing happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.24,0:19:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I remember he said\Nhis shadow was stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.86,0:19:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Then this must be the guy that did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.38,0:19:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.42,0:19:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.66,0:19:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.84,0:20:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be a Devil Fruit power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.78,0:20:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Promise it. Listen, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.88,0:20:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me keep repeating\Nmyself over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.66,0:20:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not the least bit cute\Nwhen you talk, so don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.92,0:20:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This little guy is just\Nwhat I need to bring me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.14,0:20:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,one step closer to becoming\Nking of the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.36,0:20:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Doctor Hawkback.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.98,0:20:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Since the time I met you, ten years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.46,0:20:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I've put all my time, resources,\Nand energy into making number 900.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.90,0:20:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,With that shadow, it will make\Nthe greatest zombie of all time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.26,0:20:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,With that power at your fingertips,\Nnothing will be beyond your reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.50,0:20:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That means it will only\Nbe a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.82,0:20:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I become the\Ncemetery king of the entire
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.16,0:20:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,world and I'll transform\Nall the cute creatures of
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.58,0:20:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,the world into zombies\Nthen I'll have an entire
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.86,0:20:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,adorable kingdom full of\Nservants that never talk back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.60,0:20:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.51,0:20:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter who the person is,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.90,0:20:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,how powerful they are or how\Nstrong-willed they may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.90,0:21:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Once their shadow is taken and placed\Nin another, they bow to your will.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.64,0:21:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon I'll fill the world with my servants.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.12,0:21:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'd had an army like that\Nbefore, I wouldn't have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.42,0:21:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,beaten by that idiot\NKaido in the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.44,0:21:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's about time we\Nopen his eyes, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.74,0:21:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoro, Nien, bow! Yes,\NMaster! What's your command?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.28,0:21:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on ahead and open the door\Nto the special refrigerator.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.30,0:21:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.21,0:21:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.54,0:21:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost time, sweet 900.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.96,0:21:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,In but a few moments, your\Neyes will open at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.94,0:21:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The perfect shadow has finally\Nfound its way to my doorstep.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.36,0:21:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Spider-Mouse, come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.50,0:21:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.41,0:21:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Take Straw Hat Luffy's body\Nand throw it back on his ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.60,0:21:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure to remove those webs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.52,0:21:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be in trouble if he dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.72,0:21:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.63,0:21:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I have an urgent report to give you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.66,0:21:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.60,0:21:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Just moments ago, the spider monkey\NCaptain Tararon was defeated by intruders!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.34,0:21:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Defeated?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.14,0:21:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, what does that matter as\Nlong as his shadow wasn't removed?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.26,0:21:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's just it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.17,0:21:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,His shadow was removed!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.40,0:22:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're certain of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.78,0:22:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, there's no doubt!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.34,0:22:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Absalom!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.72,0:22:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Only one man is capable of doing this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.68,0:22:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He has returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.02,0:22:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn that humming swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.78,0:22:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems the reports I received this\Nmorning weren't so crazy after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.32,0:22:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How could this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.64,0:22:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The humming swordsman is running around
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.16,0:22:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,removing every zombie\Nshadow he comes across!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.60,0:22:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of nowhere, the number of\Ncasualties has gone through the roof!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.52,0:22:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's playing out just like the
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.00,0:22:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,terrible ordeal we went\Nthrough five years ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.22,0:22:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.64,0:22:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That damned humming swordsman! Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.38,0:22:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That infuriating troublemaker\Nis the only enemy
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.86,0:22:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,we have that knows the\Nweakness of the zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.48,0:22:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,How did he manage to return here again?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.92,0:22:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And what is she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.98,0:22:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How much damage has he managed to\Ndo this time? Shandora! Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.26,0:22:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you keep blocking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.36,0:22:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The Humming Swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.74,0:22:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard many stories about him,\Nbut just what kind of a man is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.84,0:22:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't mean that you've...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.30,0:22:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Perona, are you saying you've\Nnever seen his face before?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.76,0:23:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I see then.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.38,0:23:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's probably how he slipped\Npast your ghost network undetected.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.62,0:23:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so it would seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.70,0:23:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, apparently that humming\Npain in the ass has returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.88,0:23:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.00,0:23:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't bother me with such nonsense, idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.28,0:23:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.40,0:23:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.60,0:23:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.51,0:23:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's make our\Nway to the refrigerator.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.76,0:23:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, I have news concerning\Nthe current situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.08,0:23:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say so before?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.66,0:23:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.57,0:23:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's the case, slowing\Nhim down shouldn't be an issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.62,0:23:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep me informed of any more\Nproblems should they arise!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.98,0:23:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now hurry up and dump\NStraw Hat on the boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.86,0:23:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.77,0:23:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.69,0:23:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He lost his shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.72,0:23:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't mean he's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.86,0:23:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember Brooke said so.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.68,0:23:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumasi! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.18,0:24:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't just hop out right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.38,0:24:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for the right moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.78,0:24:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like they have\Nplans for Luffy's shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.08,0:24:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to keep hiding\Nin here to find out where
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.82,0:24:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,they're taking it so\Nwe can rescue it later!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.24,0:24:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,To think that Tararan\Nwas defeated. Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.92,0:24:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,More importantly, where is the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.44,0:24:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I must find them and slice them!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.08,0:24:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Franky.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.08,0:24:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.26,0:24:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong. I'm not crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.86,0:24:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not crying, you punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.36,0:24:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop looking at me already!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.92,0:24:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.78,0:24:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you ask him about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.70,0:24:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.84,0:24:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I have my reasons, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.90,0:24:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.20,0:24:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.54,0:24:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I love that damn skeleton!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.04,0:24:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the nicest guy in the whole world!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.78,0:24:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.82,0:25:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.46,0:25:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You just don't know when to quit, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.04,0:25:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.08,0:25:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.86,0:25:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Men cower in fear at the mere mention\Nof the Swordmaster Ryuma. Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.22,0:25:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing more than my shadow.\NYet my body is much stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.98,0:25:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll return you to where\Nyou belong, beneath my feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.50,0:25:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.42,0:25:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,When I first came across this corpse in\Nthe Land of Ice, I couldn't stop shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.76,0:25:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I was trembling.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.20,0:25:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's simply fascinating to think that such
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.52,0:25:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,a monstrous creature\Nwas alive and breathing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.62,0:25:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,wreaking havoc across\Nthe seas 500 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.74,0:25:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The countries that fell at\Nhis hands were taken whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.12,0:25:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Under his strength, a legendary\Nnation of criminals was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.22,0:25:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Imagine my surprise when\NI found myself staring
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.76,0:25:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,at the demon they called\Nthe continent below.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.10,0:26:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, it keeps getting colder and colder.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.24,0:26:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Where in the world were\Nthese guys going anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.88,0:26:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.02,0:26:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,but they said something earlier about\Nsome sort of special refrigerator,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.30,0:26:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,didn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.21,0:26:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I'm going to\Nrevive this extraordinary creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.30,0:26:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This will go down in the\Nbooks of zombie creationists.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.92,0:26:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Century, why do you keep blocking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.34,0:26:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Another legend will be\Nbrought back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.84,0:26:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The time for his revival is finally here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.18,0:26:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, the only warrior in history
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.32,0:26:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,who was ruthless and powerful\Nenough to be given the name Devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.54,0:26:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Oz.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.66,0:26:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
